@1000 conn#2 sends Talk vid=2
   -> send conn#2 ShopOpened vid=2 [0: 3001x1 for 400, 1: 3004x10 for 40, 2: 3009x1 for 900000]
-- closed: buying does nothing
@1000 conn#2 sends ShopClose
@1000 conn#2 sends ShopBuy 1
-- open again, then walking 30 m away: the shop is forgotten at the next purchase
@1000 conn#2 sends Talk vid=2
   -> send conn#2 ShopOpened vid=2 [0: 3001x1 for 400, 1: 3004x10 for 40, 2: 3009x1 for 900000]
@1000 conn#2 sends CharacterMove kind=1 (475000, 969100)
@11000 conn#2 sends CharacterMove kind=0 (475000, 969100)
@11000 conn#2 sends ShopBuy 1
-- back beside the keeper, buying still needs the shop open again
@11000 conn#2 sends CharacterMove kind=1 (475000, 966100)
@21000 conn#2 sends CharacterMove kind=0 (475000, 966100)
@21000 conn#2 sends ShopBuy 1
